0..77 Comment "// A theory whose operation lands at a sort that two calls index. The sort of"
78..153 Comment "// the second call has the first call as its index. Another theory includes"
154..212 Comment "// it, and a function takes a model of it and returns one."
213..215 Comment "//"
216..294 Comment "// The model type of such a theory states the operation as a function into the"
295..369 Comment "// family at those two calls. The include and the function form that type."
370..372 Comment "//"
373..451 Comment "// Each index that applies an operation stands in its family call as the value"
452..527 Comment "// that the call returns. The later index then reads the same value, so the"
528..550 Comment "// family call checks."
551..553 Comment "//"
554..569 Comment "// - see: #5051"
